**Shadows can soften up enemies, making it easier to revive with {{Focus|Last Gasp}}.
*Shadows draw enemy attention, they are effective at defending objectives or areas of a map.
**Shadows are not reliable defenders when there are more than '''7''' enemies, or enemies are using explosives.
*Actively target and focus your attacks on enemies you want to clone prior to casting the ability.
*Because you still take full damage during the long summoning animation, it might be useful to cast {{A|Terrify}} just before using this skill.
*{{Stat|Shield}} buffing Shadows (i.e. {{E|Orokin Drone}}) can be used as a temporary survival measure in [[Survival]] when the oxygen runs out, as disconnecting/connecting to them will instantly regenerate your shield.
*{{A|Shadows of the Dead}} pairs extremely well with a subsumed {{A|Blood Altar}}, as that ability's healing aura greatly outpaces the passive health decay that Shadows suffer, as long as they stay within its radius. With attentive use, Altars are capable of keeping Shadows alive indefinitely, even under heavy fire and the use of {{M|Shield of Shadows}}.
*{{Weapon|Sancti Magistar|Sancti Magistar's}} [[Lifesteal]] can easily outheal the {{stat|Health}} decay of summons on top of healing {{WF|Nekros}} .
